[
  {
    "screen": 1,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "半夜十一点，亲戚打来电话：",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 2,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "孩子住院，押金还差两万——",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 3,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这样的钱，您借不借？",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 4,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这叫救急，人命关天的难处，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 5,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "搭把手是情分。",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 6,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "可还有一种借：借去填窟窿、",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 7,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "堵亏空，",
    "chars": 4
  },
  {
    "screen": 8,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "填进去多少都是无底洞。",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 9,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "老话讲，救急不救穷。",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 10,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "先说清：这句是民间老话，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 11,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "不是书里的原话；",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 12,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "书里真正写着的，",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 13,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "是《中国式人情世故》第二章",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 14,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "那句——",
    "chars": 4
  },
  {
    "screen": 15,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "人情要厚积，关系在往来。",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 16,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "再说我自己的做法：",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 17,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "钱往外借之前，",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 18,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "先把归还的约定说清楚，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 19,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "什么时候还、怎么还，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 20,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "当场说明白，金额大小都一样。",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 21,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这钱舍不舍得当人情送了，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 22,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "是借之前自己拿的主意，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 23,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "不是借出去以后被迫算了。",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 24,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "约定在先，钱借得安心，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 25,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "交情也处得长久。",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 26,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这本书我放在主页橱窗里了，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 27,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 28,
    "line_id": "A10",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "您借出去的钱，",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 29,
    "line_id": "A10",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "后来要回来了吗？",
    "chars": 8
  }
]